                                                "sense_id": "84dfac37-b48e-3a05-aab5-047ca0de2e39",
                                                "text": "Thou art more than the Gods who number the days of our temporal breath; / For these give labour and slumber; but thou, Proserpina, death."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cfe4c97c-9acd-3437-938e-72a57da5046e",
